# Environment Variables for MeDay Backend
#
# The chatbot's optional AI layer runs on Google Gemini only. Everything below
# this line is optional — the chatbot works fully on its deterministic core
# with no key set at all.

# Preferred: paste the key into the admin panel (Admin Dashboard -> "עוזר
# ה-AI של הצ'אט") instead of setting it here — it's stored in the database so
# the clinic can rotate it without a deploy. This env var is only a fallback
# for local development or if you'd rather manage it as infra config.
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Model alias. Defaults to gemini-2.5-flash in code (chatbot_config.py) if unset.
# Override here (or as a Render env var) without editing code if you hit the
# free-tier daily quota — gemini-3.5-flash has a larger free bucket at the
# same API shape. Enabling billing on the Google Cloud project removes the
# quota ceiling entirely; actual cost at this app's traffic is a few
# cents-to-dollars/month.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
